WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.721
Duplicate detection depends on the identity rule
Email alone may

00:00:05.747 --> 00:00:11.489
be useful but can fail when emails are shared or
changed Name plus email

00:00:11.516 --> 00:00:17.363
can be stronger but may miss rows with incomplete
values Phone can provide

00:00:17.389 --> 00:00:23.035
supporting evidence but is not perfect For sensitive
data possible

00:00:23.061 --> 00:00:26.022
duplicates often need multiple signals and review
